target/
# FAR Manager's sources for reference (not part of the build): git clone https://github.com/FarGroup/FarManager far-source
far-source/
# NetBox's sources for its behaviour only (GPL: none of its code is taken; S6.4-S6.6):
# git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/michaellukashov/Far-NetBox netbox-source
netbox-source/
# Colorer's sources (MIT: its engine is ported, ADR-0024) and its schemes (LGPL: shipped as data):
# git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/colorer/Colorer-library colorer-source
# git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/colorer/FarColorer farcolorer-source
# git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/colorer/Colorer-schemes colorer-schemes
colorer-source/
farcolorer-source/
colorer-schemes/

# Local working files (e2e stands, scratch scripts); never committed
tmp/

# Local only, not the project's (owner 2026-11-22): the agents' settings, the quality gate's tool and
# configuration (its architecture, decisions and diagrams stay: they document the project), the internal
# plan, debt and reviews.
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
/.codeguard/*
!/.codeguard/architecture.md
!/.codeguard/decisions/
!/.codeguard/diagrams/
docs/reviews/
docs/roadmap.md
docs/tech-debt.md
docs/README.md
